  <item>
    <title>04.ᥛᥫᥒᥰ ᥐᥣᥲ ᥛᥫᥒᥰ ᥝᥨᥝᥰ 傣寨见闻，我从来没过过一个宗教色彩这么浓厚的春节</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c68f2eb0167b8db95e033a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c68f2eb0167b8db95e033a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Mar 2025 05:55:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi大家，这里是播客「1-1切克闹」，今天是2025年3月4号，妇女节前夕</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的内容是我在2025年春节期间的种种见闻，有新奇，有惊喜，也有始料未及的痛楚</span></p><span></span><p><span>我从来没有过过宗教气息这么浓厚、像万花筒一样斑斓，心底却万分安宁的一个春节</span></p><span></span><p><span>对云南普洱、跨境少数民族、南传佛教、咖啡文化感兴趣的朋友，今天节目比较对你胃口</span></p><span></span><p><span>宗教方面的内容是我第一次涉足，或有不妥之处，敬请指正。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 最近销声匿迹的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> 回傣寨=10次心理疏导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 傣寨环境、居民给我的安宁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 云南普洱景谷简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 这个春节之于我，是一次珍贵的近身田野调查机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 普洱游记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 北归咖仓庄园手冲冰咖初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 在成都喝咖和在普洱喝咖的不同体感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> 和爸妈见面吃傣味！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> 和好朋友夜游戴家巷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 在普洱太阳河国家森林公园探索自然，见世面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 大开河梅子咖啡庄园里的时间减速带</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 普洱“绿三角”路线的咖啡哲理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 回外婆家景谷的路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 除夕前日，用食物链接情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 节前一天景谷农贸市场的景象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 虫虫那么可爱，怎么可以不吃虫虫？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 大年初一的仪式感——賧佛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 粗略划分国内佛教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 第一次参加賧佛，现场语言全加密，一听一个不吱声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 傣族先民的先进生态观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a> 重游儿时故地——景谷勐卧总佛寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 百年菩提树下，血清素充值满格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2719">45:19</a> 我赖以生存的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a> 在河岸边进行一场颇具诗意的「祈福法会」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> 让我印象深刻、体感惬意的「洒净」仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a> 收尾环节——滴水回向、拴线仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3119">51:59</a> 景谷的春节，感觉不到片刻的枯萎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 我对“很深的福报”的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> 善良未必是高尚或者牺牲，有时候只是细微简单的看见、接纳、允许和尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3357">55:57</a> 让人与人之间紧密联系在一起的原因是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> “这个世界从来没有为一个孩子的到来做好准备”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3534">58:54</a> 当人对人是鹅卵石的时代，就只剩下孤零零的坚硬与自求多福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">59:56</a> 在朋友圈里，差不多失去所有的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3639">60:39</a> 人不再互相需要的具体表现是：每个人越来越喜欢孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3646">60:46</a>“具体的抽象”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">61:32</a> 熊培云《人的消逝》提醒我：每个人心中都应该有神庙，去堆放很多该被烧掉的东西</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f31a25abc0fc7de2062803/lqZ9ygq9E_NOpx2AukP441n7f1Bd.m4a" length="60593707" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsZOIQ7nd3j-rUFCHJgoOlgw-tI0.png"/>
