  <item>
    <title>03.一个差点意思的假期开场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6793fa7bd74435e4a39c8c86</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6793fa7bd74435e4a39c8c86</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jan 2025 21:18:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 连我自己都没想到有天表达欲会急不可耐到在烧烤摊上也要录播客</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 五味杂陈百感交集的甲辰年最后一个工作日</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 脆弱小姚又流泪了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 前情提要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 知道但做不到的痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> “很多东西容易流进心里的人”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 今日份诞金句：矛盾不是坏词，人可以很兼容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 我不怕受伤，但我容易波动破碎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 揪不出烦恼的线头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 被永无尽头的活儿按在地上摩擦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 抽丝剥茧今天被情绪牵着鼻子走的重重原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 对自己的不解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 学不会提防和迟点交付真心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 今日启发：人和自己的缠斗是永恒的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 回云南，回让我没法压抑自己生命冲动的地方</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 伤心总是难免的，冷却下来后我的应对</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 为什么今天频频提李诞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a> 小众爱好：傣妹本妹被李诞、食贫道反向种草普洱去处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 周五深夜，一个边境城市烧烤摊上的实况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> “不要和差点意思的人周旋”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> coldplay《we pray》</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgLN-pz2vVLy6O-sAiOmNoXclwA.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f31a25abc0fc7de2062803/lukkjAvxa02O8XmPbKSYA0C2jYGZ.m4a" length="9509228" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSrKyA15pLyJZwD0xmJM4wobmAP.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
